# COLLEGE FOOTBALL PLAYOFF #

In 2024 the College Football Playoff expanded to include 12 teams in the field. The top four seeds receive a bye to the quarterfinals (New Years Six bowls) while the other eight play first round games with seeds 5 to 8 hosting the playoff games. First round games do not count as bowl games.

* The eventual national champion


# ALABAMA AND THE NFL #

Eight former Alabama football players have been inducted into the  [LINK: (Pro Football Hall of Fame) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pro_Football_Hall_of_Fame] , the fourth most among all colleges. [LINK: ([91]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alabama_Crimson_Tide_football#cite_note-HOF-93]

[LINK: (Jonathan Allen) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jonathan_Allen] , DT -  [LINK: (Minnesota Vikings) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minnesota_Vikings]

[LINK: (Will Anderson Jr.) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Will_Anderson_Jr.] , LB -  [LINK: (Houston Texans) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Houston_Texans]

[LINK: (Jalyn Armour-Davis) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jalyn_Armour-Davis] , CB -  [LINK: (Tennessee Titans) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennessee_Titans]

